<title>POLAND: KPW clears Polish meat firm Pozmeat for trade.</title>
<headline>KPW clears Polish meat firm Pozmeat for trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade up to one million shares in the initial public offering of meat firm Pozmeat SA, the KPW said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>KPW said the 653,041 existing shares have also been cleared.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  500,000		  June 9-18</p>
<p> Small-investor	  500,000		  June 9-18</p>
<p> Lead Manager:	   BMT SA brokerage</p>
<p> Minimum price (PLN):  25.5  Lead Underwriter:     n/a</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	expanding production capacity,</p>
<p>			     investments in its firms</p>
<p>Note: * - price as estimated by the firm, the final issue price will be set later. The company seeks a parallel market market listing.</p>
<p>EARNINGS DATA	   1997 forecast     1996	1995</p>
<p>(in million of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:	     n/a		    0.5	 0.1</p>
<p> Sales:		    n/a		  131.7     113.4</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p>Animex Wielkopolska Sp z oo, a subsidiary of Animex - 13 pct of shares or 17.7 pct of votes</p>
<p>Hormel Foods Corporation - 13 pct of shares or 17.7 percent of votes</p>
<p>state treasury - 17.9 pct of shares or 8.1 percent votes on the shareholders meeting</p>
<p>No of existing shares: 690,000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
